======================================================================
  BEYOND NATURAL BASES: THE GAMMA(1/b)^b LANDSCAPE
======================================================================

======================================================================
  1. GAMMA(1/b)^b FOR ALL POSITIVE REAL b
======================================================================

         b   Gamma(1/b)   Gamma(1/b)^b      log            interpretation
    0.5000     1.000000         1.0000   0.0000                sub-binary
    1.0000     1.000000         1.0000   0.0000           unary (trivial)
    1.6180     1.449230         1.8227   0.6003              golden ratio
    2.0000     1.772454         3.1416   1.1447      BINARY = TOURNAMENTS
    2.7183     2.417885        11.0227   2.4000            Euler's number
    3.0000     2.678939        19.2260   2.9563                   TERNARY
